 {"slug":"hospitality","name":"Hospitality Marketing","title":"Hotel Marketing in Tirupati | Hei Digi","desc":"Hotel and hospitality marketing in Tirupati with local search, profile photos, social content, Reels and enquiry campaigns planned by Hei Digi.","intro":"Guests need clear location, room or service information, current photos and a simple booking route. Hospitality content should set accurate expectations and make the next step easy.","needs":"We can support hotel profiles, room and amenity content, location pages, seasonal creatives and paid campaigns. Prices, availability, amenities and booking links must be confirmed by the property before publication.","services":["seo","google-business-profile-management","social-media-marketing","meta-ads","video-editing-ai-videos","creative-design"],"faq":[("Can you guarantee bookings?","No. Availability, rates, competition and guest decisions all influence bookings."),("Can you create room Reels?","Yes, using approved property footage or a separately scoped shoot."),("Will you update photos and profile details?","We can manage approved updates and flag details that the property needs to verify."),("Can campaigns target visitors to Tirupati?","We can plan location and audience settings available on the chosen advertising platform, then monitor delivery.")]},
